<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Whirlpool raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Whirlpool raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said it upgraded Whirlpool Corp to marketperform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Whirlpool gained 1/2 to 50-1/8.</p>
</text>
